    {
      "heading": "The enhanced greenhouse effect",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "Without it, Earth would be about minus 18 degrees, not 15.",
          "write": "−18 °C vs 15 °C"
        },
        {
          "say": "So the natural effect is needed. The enhanced effect is the problem.",
          "write": "natural needed, enhanced = problem"
        },
        {
          "say": "Humans burn fossil fuels and clear forests. That adds carbon dioxide."
        },
        {
          "say": "Livestock, rice and gas leaks add methane.",
          "write": "methane"
        },
        {
          "say": "Carbon dioxide went from about 280 to over 400 parts per million.",
          "write": "280 ppm → >400 ppm",
          "draw": {
