          "say": "The greenhouse effect is not the ozone hole.",
          "write": "≠ ozone hole"
        },
        {
          "say": "Greenhouse gases do not trap sunlight. They absorb infrared from the surface."
        },
        {
          "say": "Plants respire all the time, not just at night."
